Package: Canton
Title: Unified Figure Export and Font Tools for Scientific Graphics
Version: 0.0.7
Authors@R:
    person("Tim", "Holy", , "timholy@sina.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2254-1871"))
Description: Provides a unified interface for exporting figures created with
    base graphics, 'ggplot2', 'grid', 'pheatmap', and 'ComplexHeatmap' to PDF,
    PNG, JPEG, and TIFF files. It selects a rendering strategy according to the
    plot-object type and can export one figure to multiple formats in a single
    call. Additional tools provide checked, session-level font configuration,
    reusable figure presets, publication-oriented themes, colour palettes,
    font diagnostics, quiet package loading, and directory management.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/ScienceAdvances/Canton
